            "An intentionally vulnerable demo, covering only known integrated paths. Runs used limited tools and a 15-turn budget; verdicts used regex matching. Results are not independently reproducible. This is neither product validation of the three gates nor a ranking of vendors.",
          note: "The README below is the source for this public experiment, separate from the internal trial. Detailed conditions are in “Technical and integration details” at the end of this page.",
          records: [
            "All five scenarios reported in the public README, with Opus 4.8 as the attacker.",
          ],
          link: "See test conditions and results",
          patterns: [
            "Unauthorized data exfiltration",
            "Audit trail tampering",
            "Zero-day RCE",
            "SIEM evasion",
            "Social engineering",
          ],
        },
        {
          operation:
            "Test-memo appends were tried manually from the trial screen in a local environment. They involved harmless database rows only, with no external effect.",
          scope:
            "Only test-memo appends were tried. The trial did not validate transfers, account changes, external actions or data-loss prevention in business operations.",
          status:
            "Transfer and account change gates are in design. The agent action gate is in internal testing, with no business deployment. Human trials and a release decision are pending.",
          records: [
            "A request meeting the conditions went through and added a memo.",
            "Attempts to reuse the same request, omit or incorrectly format the information needed for the check, or alter the request stopped without adding another memo.",
          ],
        },
      ],
      closeTitle: "Add a check just before execution in your existing workflow.",
      consultItems: [
        {
          title: "Keep your existing system",
          detail: "Plan around your existing business system, approval flow and data. Choose the operation you want to protect.",
        },
        {
          title: "Connect a check before execution",
          detail: "Add a call to Proof Gate immediately before the chosen operation runs, comparing the request with the agreed conditions.",
        },
        {
          title: "Proceed only when conditions match",
          detail:
            "The existing system runs only requests that pass the check. Requests that do not match stop before execution.",
        },
      ],
      integrationScope: "Paths without the check are outside its coverage.",
      technicalTitle: "Technical and integration details",
      technicalBody:
        "In the internal agent trial, zero-knowledge proofs (ZK) bind the permitted scope, delegation and current request. Cryptography alone does not verify a real organization or person, or establish that the inputs are true. The business must verify identities and the basis for its conditions.",
      technicalEvidence: [
        {
          title: "Public experiment: conditions and verdicts",
          paragraphs: [
            "The five scenarios cover sensitive data retrieval and decryption, audit log changes, and transfer and approval workflows. Gates at known enforcement points in the intentionally vulnerable demo require proof on every mutation and sensitive-read path across all five scenarios. Audit log changes and recommits also use requireZkProof.",
            "The attacker uses http_request, with run_shell added only for the RCE (remote code execution) scenario. The limit is 15 turns.",
            "The README reports INSECURE=attack_succeeded and SECURE=blocked for all five scenarios with Opus 4.8 as the attacker. In the privilege-escalation example, full SSNs (US Social Security numbers) were retrieved without the gate; with the gate, no SSN data was returned without proof. The approval-flow bypass reached execution without the gate; with the gate, approval proof was required and the attack was blocked.",
            "Verdicts use regex matching against response content, rather than a rigorous evaluation method.",
            "The README states that results are not independently reproducible because model APIs change and generation settings were not fixed. This is a proof of concept, not a scientific benchmark. It does not evaluate defense in depth or resistance to attackers with unrestricted tools and time.",
          ],
        },
        {
          title: "Internal trial: conditions and records",
          paragraphs: [
            "Requests under a delegated agent identity were executed manually from the trial console on a single-machine development setup. Local Workerd and D1 were used to generate and verify a real Groth16 proof bound to the permitted scope, prior delegation and current request. The only operation was appending a test memo to D1 through sandbox_memo / sandbox:memos / append.",
            "Challenge issuance returned HTTP 201; execution after real proof generation returned HTTP 200 (verified). In D1, memo, nullifier (replay-prevention record) and consume (consumed-challenge) counts each increased by +1.",
            "Replay returned 409; missing-proof returned 403; invalid-shape returned 403; and changed-bytes returned 400. These attempts, made after the successful execution, caused no further increase in memos, replay-prevention records or consumed challenges.",
            "The invalid-shape case tested an incorrect proof format, not every kind of invalid proof. These records are not performance measurements or test-suite pass counts, and do not cover document access or sending data externally.",
            "Production cryptographic setup (trusted setup) and human trials have not been carried out, and no release decision has been made. The gate is not deployed in business operations; transfer and account change gates are in design. The public experiment's README is not a source for this internal trial.",
          ],
        },
      ],
      docs: "Read the integration guides",
      live: "Open the public registration and proof checker",
      liveNote:
        "Use a reference code (docHash) to look up a public registration and the latest proof linked to it. The retrieved proof data is verified through the public API. The conditions checked depend on the proof type. This page does not check the document text, establish the sender's identity or authorize a business action. Verifying proof data is separate from stopping an action on a business system's execution path. Records from the internal agent trial are not available through this page.",
    } as const);
const gateFields = ["work", "threat", "conditions", "pass", "block", "limit", "status"] as const;
const [publicEvidence, trialEvidence] = C.evidence;
---

<Layout
  locale={locale}
  title={C.title}
  description={C.description}
  metaType="page"
  pagePath="/cyber/"
>
  <Navigation locale={locale} t={t.nav} base={base} />
  <HubSpotDrawer />
  <main class="cy-page">
    <div class="cy-container">
      <section class="cy-hero" aria-labelledby="cy-title">
        <div class="cy-hero-copy">
          <p class="cy-brand">{C.brand}</p>
          <h1 id="cy-title">{C.headline}</h1>
          <p class="cy-intro">{C.intro}</p>
          <div class="cy-actions">
            <a
              class="cy-btn cy-primary"
              href={DISCOVERY_CALL_URL[locale]}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
            >
              {C.call}
              <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
            <a class="cy-btn cy-ghost" href="#pg-flow">
              {C.learn}
              <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="cy-hero-stage">{C.heroStage}</p>
          <p class="cy-scope">{C.scope}</p>
        </div>
        <figure id="pg-trial-screen" class="cy-trial-figure">
          <p class="cy-figure-status"><span class="cy-figure-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{C.figureStatus}</p>
          <img
            src="/assets/figures/proof-gate-trial-evidence-375.png"
            width="375"
            height="345"
            alt={C.trialAlt}
            fetchpriority="high"
          />
          <div class="cy-trial-summary">
            <p class="cy-trial-summary-label">{C.trialSummaryLabel}</p>
            <ul class="cy-trial-summary-list" role="list">
              <li class="cy-trial-summary-blocked">
                <strong>4</strong>
                <span>{C.trialSummaryBlocked}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="cy-trial-summary-executed">
                <strong>1</strong>
                <span>{C.trialSummaryExecuted}</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <figcaption id="pg-trial-caption">
            <p>{C.trialCaption}</p>
            <a class="cy-trial-caption-link" href="#pg-trial">{C.trialCaptionLink}</a>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section id="pg-flow" class="cy-section cy-value" aria-labelledby="pg-flow-title">
        <div class="cy-value-heading">
          <h2 id="pg-flow-title">{C.valueTitle}</h2>
          <p>{C.valueIntro}</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="cy-values" role="list">
          {
            C.valueCards.map((card) => (
              <li>
                <div class={`cy-value-art cy-value-art-${card.kind}`} aria-hidden="true">
                  {card.kind === "transfer" && (
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 320 170" fill="none">
                      <rect x="30" y="49" width="82" height="72" rx="14" />
                      <rect x="208" y="49" width="82" height="72" rx="14" />
                      <path d="M48 72h46M48 88h30M226 72h46M226 88h30" />
                      <path d="M122 85h76m-14-14 14 14-14 14" class="cy-value-accent-stroke" />
                      <path d="M160 34c10 7 20 8 20 8v16c0 14-9 23-20 28-11-5-20-14-20-28V42s10-1 20-8Z" class="cy-value-shield" />
                      <path d="m151 57 6 6 12-13" class="cy-value-accent-stroke" />
                    </svg>
                  )}
                  {card.kind === "account" && (
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 320 170" fill="none">
                      <path d="M60 30h82l20 20v90H60V30Z" />
                      <path d="M142 30v22h20M79 72h47M79 91h64M79 110h40" />
                      <rect x="190" y="45" width="72" height="80" rx="12" />
                      <path d="M207 68h38M207 86h28" />
                      <path d="M164 104h78m-14-14 14 14-14 14" class="cy-value-accent-stroke" />
                      <circle cx="226" cy="106" r="24" class="cy-value-shield" />
                      <path d="m215 106 8 8 15-17" class="cy-value-accent-stroke" />
                    </svg>
                  )}
                  {card.kind === "agent" && (
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 320 170" fill="none">
                      <circle cx="58" cy="48" r="18" />
                      <circle cx="58" cy="122" r="18" />
                      <circle cx="262" cy="85" r="18" />
                      <path d="M76 48h42M76 122h42M202 85h42" />
                      <path d="M160 27c23 15 45 17 45 17v37c0 32-20 53-45 64-25-11-45-32-45-64V44s22-2 45-17Z" class="cy-value-shield" />
                      <path d="M160 52v12m0 42v12m-33-33h12m42 0h12m-55-23 9 9m26 26 9 9m0-44-9 9m-26 26-9 9" class="cy-value-accent-stroke" />
                      <circle cx="160" cy="85" r="12" class="cy-value-accent-stroke" />
                    </svg>
                  )}
                </div>
                <div class="cy-value-card-body">
                  <p class:list={["cy-stage", { "cy-stage-trial": card.stageKind === "trial" }]}>
                    {card.stage}
                  </p>
                  <h3>{card.title}</h3>
                  <p>{card.detail}</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
        <a class="cy-source" href="#pg-gates">{C.gatesLink} <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </section>

      <section id="pg-evidence" class="cy-section cy-evidence" aria-labelledby="pg-evidence-title">
        <h2 id="pg-evidence-title">{C.evidenceTitle}</h2>
        <p class="cy-evidence-kind">{C.evidenceKindPublic}</p>
        <div class="cy-attack-summary">
          <div class="cy-attack-summary-insecure">
            <span>INSECURE · {C.attackWithout}</span>
            <strong>5/5</strong>
            <p><span aria-hidden="true">×</span>{C.attackSucceeded}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cy-attack-summary-secure">
            <span>SECURE · {C.attackWith}</span>
            <strong>5/5</strong>
            <p><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>{C.attackBlocked}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="cy-section-intro">{C.evidenceIntro}</p>
        {publicEvidence.records.map((record) => <p class="cy-section-intro">{record}</p>)}
        <figure class="cy-attack-figure">
          <table class="cy-attack-table" aria-labelledby="pg-evidence-title" aria-describedby="pg-attack-scope">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">{C.attackScenario}</th>
                <th scope="col"><span class="cy-attack-mode">INSECURE</span>{C.attackWithout}</th>
                <th scope="col"><span class="cy-attack-mode">SECURE</span>{C.attackWith}</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {
                publicEvidence.patterns.map((pattern) => (
                  <tr>
                    <th scope="row">{pattern}</th>
                    <td>
                      <span class="cy-attack-outcome cy-attack-insecure">
                        <span class="cy-attack-symbol" aria-hidden="true">×</span>{C.attackSucceeded}
                      </span>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      <span class="cy-attack-outcome cy-attack-secure">
                        <span class="cy-attack-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>{C.attackBlocked}
                      </span>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                ))
              }
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <figcaption id="pg-attack-scope" class="cy-boundary cy-evidence-limit">{publicEvidence.scope}</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="cy-note">{publicEvidence.note}</p>
        <a
          class="cy-source"
          href="https://github.com/lemmaoracle/example-cyber-attack#readme"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          {publicEvidence.link}
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <section id="pg-trial" class="cy-section cy-trial" aria-labelledby="pg-trial-title">
        <h2 id="pg-trial-title" class="cy-trial-title">{C.trialTitle}</h2>
        <p class="cy-evidence-kind">{C.evidenceKindTrial}</p>
        <p class="cy-evidence-takeaway">{C.evidenceTakeawayTrial}</p>
        <p class="cy-section-intro">{trialEvidence.operation}</p>
        {trialEvidence.records.map((record) => <p class="cy-section-intro">{record}</p>)}
        <p class="cy-section-intro">{C.trialReconciliation}</p>
        <a class="cy-source" href="#pg-trial-screen">
          {C.trialFigureLink}
          <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <section id="pg-gates" class="cy-section cy-gates-section" aria-labelledby="pg-gates-title">
        <h2 id="pg-gates-title">{C.gatesTitle}</h2>
        <p class="cy-section-intro">{C.gatesIntro}</p>
        <div class="cy-gates">
          {
            C.gates.map((gate) => (
              <article class="cy-example-card">
                <div>
                  <h3>{gate.title}</h3>
                  <p class:list={["cy-stage", { "cy-stage-trial": gate.stageKind === "trial" }]}>
                    {gate.stage}
                  </p>
                  <p class="cy-scenario-label">{C.scenario}</p>
                  {gate.stageKind === "trial" && (
                    <a class="cy-source" href="#pg-trial">
                      {C.evidenceLink} <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span>
                    </a>
                  )}
                </div>
                <dl class="cy-facts">
                  {gateFields.map((field) => (
                    <div>
                      <dt>{C.gateLabels[field]}</dt>
                      <dd>{gate[field]}</dd>
                    </div>
                  ))}
                </dl>
              </article>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <p class="cy-note">{C.gatesNote}</p>
      </section>

      <section id="cy-start" class="cy-section cy-close" aria-labelledby="cy-close-title">
        <h2 id="cy-close-title">{C.closeTitle}</h2>
        <dl class="cy-consult-items">
          {
            C.consultItems.map((item) => (
              <div>
                <dt>{item.title}</dt>
                <dd>{item.detail}</dd>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </dl>
        <div class="cy-close-notes">
          <p class="cy-note">{C.gatesNote}</p>
          <p class="cy-scope">{C.integrationScope}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cy-actions">
          <a
            class="cy-btn cy-primary"
            href={DISCOVERY_CALL_URL[locale]}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
          >
            {C.call}
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="pg-status" class="cy-section cy-status" aria-labelledby="pg-status-title">
        <h2 id="pg-status-title">{C.statusTitle}</h2>
        <p class="cy-section-intro">{trialEvidence.status}</p>
        <p class="cy-section-intro">{trialEvidence.scope}</p>
      </section>
      <h2 id="cy-technical-title" class="cy-details-heading">{C.technicalTitle}</h2>
      <details class="cy-details cy-technical" aria-labelledby="cy-technical-title">
        <summary>{C.technicalTitle}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="cy-details-body">
          <p>{C.technicalBody}</p>
          {
            C.technicalEvidence.map((detail) => (
              <div>
                <h3>{detail.title}</h3>
                {detail.paragraphs.map((paragraph) => (
                  <p>{paragraph}</p>
                ))}
              </div>
            ))
          }
          <a class="cy-source" href={L("/guides/")}>{C.docs} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <p>{C.liveNote}</p>
          <a class="cy-source" href={L("/verify/")}>{C.live} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer locale={locale} t={t.nav} footerT={t.footer} base={base} />
</Layout>

<style>
  .cy-page {
    background: #12140e;
    color: #f4f7ef;
    font-family: "Noto Sans JP", "Noto Sans CJK JP", sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    line-height: 1.85;
    line-break: strict;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
  }
  .cy-page *,
  .cy-page *::before,
  .cy-page *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .cy-container {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 32px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cy-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 375px);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 64px;
    padding-block: 40px 24px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .cy-hero-copy {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .cy-hero .cy-actions {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }
  .cy-hero-stage,
  .cy-hero .cy-scope {
    color: #9aa393;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .cy-hero-stage {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
  }
  .cy-hero .cy-scope {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cy-trial-figure {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 375px;
    margin: 0;
    scroll-margin-top: 100px;
  }
  .cy-trial-figure::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    inset: -24px -16px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%, rgba(168, 224, 16, 0.08), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cy-trial-figure img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid #929c85;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px -18px rgba(168, 224, 16, 0.28);
  }
  .cy-trial-summary {
    margin-top: 12px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .cy-trial-figure .cy-trial-summary-label {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: #bac1af;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .cy-trial-summary-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .cy-trial-summary-list li {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 74px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #3e4435;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #191c14;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .cy-trial-summary-list strong {
    color: #f4f7ef;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", "Noto Sans JP", "Noto Sans CJK JP", sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .cy-trial-summary-list span {
    margin-top: 6px;
    color: #bac1af;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .cy-trial-summary-list .cy-trial-summary-executed {
    border-color: #698f12;
  }
  .cy-trial-summary-list .cy-trial-summary-executed strong {
    color: #a8e010;
  }
  .cy-trial-figure figcaption {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: #bac1af;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .cy-trial-figure p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cy-figure-status,
  .cy-evidence-kind {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid #69705c;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: transparent;
    color: #bac1af;
    font: 12px/1.7 "Space Mono", monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .cy-trial-figure .cy-figure-status {
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-inline: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.005em;
  }
  .cy-figure-dot {
    flex: 0 0 8px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #a8e010;
  }
  .cy-page .cy-trial-caption-link {
    display: inline-block;
    min-height: 24px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .cy-brand {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #bac1af;
    font:
      12px/1.6 "Space Mono",
      monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .cy-page h1 {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", "Noto Sans JP", "Noto Sans CJK JP", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .cy-page h1,
  .cy-page h2,
  .cy-page h3,
  .cy-page h4 {
    line-break: strict;
    word-break: auto-phrase;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .cy-page h2 {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", "Noto Sans JP", "Noto Sans CJK JP", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(23px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
  }
  .cy-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .cy-page a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .cy-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid #69705c;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .cy-page .cy-primary {
    color: #12140e;
    background: #a8e010;
    border-color: #a8e010;
  }
  .cy-ghost {
    background: transparent;
  }
  .cy-page a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 5px;
  }
  .cy-page a:focus-visible,
  .cy-details summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #f8fafc;
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }
  .cy-page .cy-primary:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #a8e01033;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .cy-section {
    --section-bg: #12140e;
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-block: 96px;
    scroll-margin-top: 80px;
  }
  .cy-section::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    inset: 0 calc(50% - 50vw);
    background: var(--section-bg);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cy-section.cy-value {
    --section-bg: #eef2e7;
    color: #12140e;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .cy-section.cy-evidence {
    --section-bg: #171a12;
  }
  .cy-section.cy-trial {
    --section-bg: #242a1e;
  }
